---
id: org.dxos.plugin.recorder
name: RecorderPlugin
version: 0.1.0
---

Records the voice-over of a plugin-presenter deck while it is presented, slide by slide. Each slide has its own
takes, listed in the slide's Recordings companion, where a new take is recorded, played, selected as the slide's main
take, or deleted. The presentation's Recordings companion records across every slide (the recording is split into a
take per slide) and plays or downloads the voice-over assembled from each slide's main take. Every recording starts
with a 3-2-1 count-in; the presenter shows each slide's speaker notes (subtitles or a notes window, a presenter
setting) while it is read.

